# Nicanzil, Current Conductor: "Whenever a creature you control explores a nonland card, put a +1/+1 counter on Nicanzil" (CR 701.44a, 603.2). Bot1's Cenote Scout explores a
# Lightning Bolt: the Scout gets its own counter (a 2/2) and Bot1 keeps the Bolt on top; Nicanzil gets one too (a 3/4) and, the card being a nonland, is not offered the
# Plains in the hand (the land trigger is for a land card).

